ilding. The offices of one subsidiary or another can be entered in all four directions. Stairs lead up and down. The jester appears. "I've learned from years of loyalty, spinning rhymes for this noble court, that with the attention span of royalty, my poems must be short!" The jester gives a cheerful wave of farewell and vanishes, saying, "Catch you aroun', clown!" You suddenly find yourself having a bit of difficulty breathing. FrobozzCo Offices You are on Floor 18 of the FrobozzCo Building. The offices of one subsidiary or another can be entered in all four directions. Stairs lead up and down. FrobozzCo Offices You are on Floor 19 of the FrobozzCo Building. The offices of one subsidiary or another can be entered in all four directions. Stairs lead up and down. FrobozzCo Offices You are on Floor 19 of the FrobozzCo Building. The offices of one subsidiary or another can be entered in all four directions. Stairs lead up and down. FrobozzCo Offices South You are in an office on floor 19 of the FrobozzCo Building. The office has a lovely southern exposure. The only exit is to the north. You can see a T-square here. FrobozzCo Offices South You are in an office on floor 19 of the FrobozzCo Building. The office has a lovely southern exposure. The only exit is to the north. You can see a T-square here. You're still having trouble breathing. It's probably due to the clown nose that's clamped in the middle of your face. You pick up the T-square. [Your score has just gone up by 12.] You remove the red clown nose. Dropped. FrobozzCo Offices You are on Floor 19 of the FrobozzCo Building. The offices of one subsidiary or another can be entered in all four directions. Stairs lead up and down. FrobozzCo Offices You are on Floor 18 of the FrobozzCo Building. The offices of one subsidiary or another can be entered in all four directions. Stairs lead up and down. FrobozzCo Offices You are on Floor 18 of the FrobozzCo Building. The offices of one subsidiary or another can be entered i