 treacherous path, and tumble painfully down a steep incline. Amazingly, you hold on to everything you have. You roll to a stop as dim green light filters around you... Great Underground Woods You are surrounded by tall oaks and wide pines. Birds chirp in the distance. Trails wind north and southwest among the trees. A fox is leaning against a nearby tree, looking sly. Great Underground Woods You are surrounded by tall oaks and wide pines. Birds chirp in the distance. Trails wind north and southwest among the trees. A fox is leaning against a nearby tree, looking sly. Great Underground Savannah Dimwit's mania for including every conceivable ecosystem under his roof continues here. This flat grassland ends at woods to the northeast, and at a desert to the west. A herd of unicorns is grazing nearby. You can see a larger fly here. Great Underground Savannah Dimwit's mania for including every conceivable ecosystem under his roof continues here. This flat grassland ends at woods to the northeast, and at a desert to the west. A herd of unicorns is grazing nearby. You can see a larger fly here. Your gloved hand strikes with amazing speed, but the fly darts out of the way by a hair's breadth. You trudge along beneath the searing gaze of an artificial desert sun... Edge of Desert Dimwit wanted a sandbox, but thanks to his lack of perspective he ended up with a desert. The bulk of the desert lies to the south; paths lead in the other cardinal directions. Edge of Desert Dimwit wanted a sandbox, but thanks to his lack of perspective he ended up with a desert. The bulk of the desert lies to the south; paths lead in the other cardinal directions. You trudge along beneath the searing gaze of an artificial desert sun... Ring of Dunes You are surrounded by sand dunes on all sides but the east. You can see a camel here. Ring of Dunes You are surrounded by sand dunes on all sides but the east. You can see a camel here. You trudge along beneath the searing gaze of an artificial desert 